WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:06.044
Video 26. Hisaab Docs bill vaanchine voucher
banaave chhe.

00:00:06.244 --> 00:00:09.949
Hisaab Docs bill vaanche chhe: photo, ke PDF.

00:00:09.879 --> 00:00:13.841
Fast reader offline, aa PC par j kaam kare
chhe.

00:00:13.771 --> 00:00:20.297
Pachhi Hisaab aankda tapaase chhe: darek line,
GST, total, ane GSTIN.

00:00:20.228 --> 00:00:25.425
Tame draft tapaaso chho, ane ene voucher
tarike save karo chho.

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:31.782
Alt+O thi Import khule chhe. Hisaab Docs no
menu ma alag bhaag chhe.

00:00:32.862 --> 00:00:40.966
I thi bill nu import khule chhe: voucher type, mode,
ane reader. F4 thi files pasand thaay chhe.

00:00:42.046 --> 00:00:49.547
Bills tamara phone parthi pan aave chhe: Scan from
Phone. E Draft Transactions ma raah jue chhe.

00:00:49.577 --> 00:00:56.679
R thi Draft Transactions khule chhe. Hisaab
darek bill vaanche chhe, ane tapaase chhe.

00:00:57.379 --> 00:01:06.801
Mehta Fabrics nu bill darek check ma pass thayu. Enter thi
voucher dekhaay chhe: party, items, ane GST.

00:01:06.831 --> 00:01:17.921
Kothari Textile na bill par dhyaan aapo. Hisaab darek nishphal
check bataave chhe: line 1, CGST ane SGST, ane beeja 7.

00:01:17.951 --> 00:01:25.807
Enu voucher adhuru chhe. Tame bill joine ene
sudhaaro, ke Alt+X thi bill reject karo.

00:01:25.837 --> 00:01:31.632
F10 thi Mehta Fabrics no tapaaselo draft
voucher tarike save thaay chhe.

00:01:32.837 --> 00:01:37.339
F8 thi je drafts have vouchers chhe e dekhaay
chhe.

00:01:37.819 --> 00:01:44.544
Hisaab bill vaanche chhe ane aankda tapaase
chhe. Tame tapaaso ane save karo.

00:01:44.474 --> 00:01:48.136
Have pachhi: help, support file, ane updates.

